","targetText":"燕燕于飛，差池其羽。之子于歸，遠送于野。瞻望弗及，泣涕如雨。","targetNotes":"首章。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《詩經集傳/卷之二》燕燕首章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":5,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"燕燕于飛，頡之頏之。之子于歸，遠于將之。瞻望弗及，佇立以泣。","targetNotes":"第二章。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《詩經集傳/卷之二》燕燕第二章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":5,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"燕燕于飛，上下其音。之子于歸，遠送于南。瞻望弗及，實勞我心。","targetNotes":"第三章。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《詩經集傳/卷之二》燕燕第三章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":5,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"仲氏任只，其心塞淵。終温且惠，淑慎其身。先君之思，以勗寡人。","targetNotes":"第四章。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《詩經集傳/卷之二》燕燕第四章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null}]},{"id":"0005","order":5,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"燕燕四章章六句","targetNotes":"章句总说。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《詩經集傳/卷之二》燕燕章句总说。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0005-1","attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null}]}]}}}
